Source: vintner-boot
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: zcomputerwiz <zcomputerwiz@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: vintner-core
Architecture: all
Description: Common boot metadata schema, manifest validation, state model, CLI and API.
 Contains the publisher (kernel/initramfs hooks, image build/verify/sign, atomic staging and garbage collection), health checks and the BIOS blessing service.

Package: vintner-platform
Architecture: all
Description: Inert platform payloads installed under /usr/lib/vintner/payloads/.
 Includes systemd-boot and shim binaries, GRUB core image and modules, and recovery images. Installing or upgrading this package never touches the ESP, boot storage or NVRAM.

Package: vintner-installer
Architecture: all
Description: Guided/automated installation integration, partition setup, firmware probe, boot entry registration.
 Later also provides a udeb.
